{"id":"sentiment","lemma":"sentiment","pos":"noun","rank":967,"glosses":["a sentiment, general thought, sense or feeling","an opinion"],"ipa":"/sɑ̃.ti.mɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/06/Fr-sentiment.ogg/Fr-sentiment.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"sentiments"},"formAudio":{"sentiments":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6c/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-sentiments.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Je comprends tes sentiments.","en":"I understand your feelings.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to understand","l":"comprendre"},{"g":"your"},null]},{"text":"Je connais ce sentiment.","en":"I know the feeling.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know","l":"connaître"},{"g":"this / it"},null]},{"text":"J'ai des sentiments pour toi.","en":"I have feelings for you.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"you"}]},{"text":"En as-tu également le sentiment ?","en":"Do you feel it, too?","words":[{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"equally"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Avez-vous tous le même sentiment ?","en":"Do you all feel that way?","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"all"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"same"},null]}]}